{
  "id": "minimax-h3-10eros-beta5-pack",
  "name": "Community — MiniMax H3 (10Eros Max beta5)",
  "version": "1.1.7",
  "author": "TenStrip",
  "nsfw": true,
  "description": "Model format: int8 ConvRot. Steps: 20 by default.\n\nMiniMax H3 on TenStrip's 10Eros Max beta5, the current release of the finetune (the author calls beta5 the only functional build; betas 3 and 4 are withdrawn). This is the HYBRID file: one 21 GB INT8 checkpoint carries both the first-frame and the reference-to-video character, so text-, image- and reference-to-video all run on it and reference shots no longer borrow the first-frame base. Built from seven concept-grouped grafts and consensus merges of 20+ LoRAs on the delta1024 H3 merge, with transferred character from LTX 2.3, Wan 2.2 and Krea 2 (their community licences apply to those portions alongside the MiniMax H3 licence). Same-seed bake-off against the original 10Eros Max pack on a 12 GB RTX 4070 Ti, 5 s at 480p: cleaner faces (no mouth smear), real motion on action prompts, and about 20% faster at the same 20 steps. The original 10Eros Max packs stay available unchanged; this is a separate download.",
  "tags": [
    "Local",
    "Video",
    "T2V",
    "MiniMax H3",
    "Finetune",
    "10Eros"
  ],
