      "description": "Text to video on 10Eros Max beta5, which the author calls the only functional build of this release line. It runs the same way as the stock H3 preset, so the checkpoint is the only difference. One file covers text, image and reference shots.\n\nAgainst the original 10Eros Max pack on the same seeds it was about 20% faster, with no mouth artefact on a still portrait and motion blur and neon streaks on a tracking shot where the original stayed static.\n\nA five-second 480p shot takes about 2 minutes on a 12 GB card with the app's Faster Attention on. The scripted line arrived word-perfect at the scripted time.\n\nThe author's advice: keep Spectrum and step caching off for reference-driven shots, because they cost accuracy. Free system RAM matters more than VRAM; keep 16 GB or more free.\n\nLicence: the MiniMax H3 licence applies, along with the community licences of LTX 2.3, Wan 2.2 and Krea 2 for the character grafted from them.\n\nModel format: int8 ConvRot.",
